sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Submit as SMTP submission server
    participant DNS as DNS MX lookup
    participant Relay as Recipient mail exchanger
    participant Mailbox
    User->>Submit: Authenticated message submission over TLS
    Submit->>DNS: Find MX for recipient domain
    DNS-->>Submit: Ordered mail exchanger candidates
    Submit->>Relay: SMTP session and message transfer
    Relay->>Mailbox: Local delivery after policy checks
    Note over Submit,Relay: Temporary failures may be queued and retried
